{
 "encounter_id": "00797",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Morning! I'll tell you what, I woke up three mornings in a row with a face like a balloon. Puffy eyes, puffy cheeks. By lunchtime it's gone down. My wife said I should come."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for coming. When did you first notice it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Last Monday. So, five days. It's worse in the morning, and it settles by the afternoon."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other swelling, like your ankles or your tummy?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My ankles are a bit puffy at night, now you mention it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you noticed any change in your urine, foamy, dark, or less of it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's a bit frothy, the last week or so. I thought it was the new loo cleaner."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What tablets are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 mg once a day, for my blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. Pulse, pressure, and so on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 148 over 92, temperature 36.7, oxygen 98 percent, weight 88 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that bad? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The pressure is a bit higher than I'd like. Let me look at your face and ankles. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You have a puffy, slightly swollen look around both eyes, and there's pitting swelling above both ankles."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What's causing it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm not going to put a name on it yet. Puffy eyes in the morning, swollen ankles, frothy urine, and raised blood pressure together could point to the kidneys, so I'd like to look properly. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The kidneys? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's one of the possibilities, and not the only one. I'd like to arrange a urine test today, to measure protein."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd also like to take blood tests, for kidney function."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Meanwhile, cut the salt, put your feet up in the evening, and don't take any anti-inflammatory painkillers like ibuprofen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I take ibuprofen for my back, sometimes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please don't, until we've seen the results. Paracetamol's fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three days, with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three days. Okay. Should I worry about the blood pressure, too? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll look at it again when the results are in, and decide then. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fair enough. Thanks, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
